e em_rename run em_run jobs em_list_jobs reconnect em_reconnect status em_status_action cancel em_cancel log em_log_action results em_results publish em_publish field em_field field_3d em_field_3d runtime em_runtime profile em_profile publish_charts em_publish_charts export_field em_export_field}} layout {row 0 column 0 sticky new}} {id model_id type field parent model_form properties label\ \{Model\ ID\}\ datatype\ string\ default\ em_model layout {row 0 column 0 sticky ew}} {id physics type choice parent model_form properties label\ Physics\ choices\ \{electrostatic_2d\ magnetostatic_2d\}\ default\ electrostatic_2d layout {row 1 column 0 sticky ew}} {id half_width type field parent model_form properties label\ \{Half\ domain\ width\ (m)\}\ datatype\ double\ default\ 0.05\ min\ 0 layout {row 2 column 0 sticky ew}} {id height type field parent model_form properties label\ \{Full\ domain\ height\ (m)\}\ datatype\ double\ default\ 0.1\ min\ 0 layout {row 3 column 0 sticky ew}} {id model_note type label parent model_form properties {text {Linear static planar 2D. Width = twice half width. Solver configuration belongs to Configuration → Runtime.} wraplength 280} layout {row 4 column 0 sticky ew}} {id material_form type section parent materials properties title\ \{Linear\ material\ parameters\} layout {row 0 column 0 sticky new}} {id eps_r type field parent material_form properties label\ \{Relative\ permittivity\ εr\ (1)\}\ datatype\ double\ default\ 1\ min\ 0 layout {row 0 column 0 sticky ew}} {id mu_r type field parent material_form properties label\ \{Conductor\ relative\ permeability\ μr\ (1)\}\ datatype\ double\ default\ 1\ min\ 0 layout {row 1 column 0 sticky ew}} {id material_note type label parent material_form properties {text {Electrostatic εr is homogeneous. Magnetic exterior air has μr = 1. Only the selected physics enters its equations; retained inactive values are not additional physics.} wraplength 280} layout {row 2 column 0 sticky ew}} {id excitation_form type section parent excitation properties title\ \{Boundary\ conditions\ and\ source\} layout {row 0 column 0 sticky new}} {id voltage type field parent excitation_form properties label\ \{Right\ boundary\ potential\ (V)\}\ datatype\ double\ default\ 10 layout {row 0 column 0 sticky ew}} {id radius type field parent excitation_form properties label\ \{Axial\ conductor\ radius\ (m)\}\ datatype\ double\ default\ 0.01\ min\ 0 layout {row 1 column 0 sticky ew}} {id current_density type field parent excitation_form properties label\ \{Axial\ current\ density\ Jz\ (A/m²)\}\ datatype\ double\ default\ 1000000 layout {row 2 column 0 sticky ew}} {id boundary_note type label parent excitation_form properties {text {Electric: left 0 V, right applied V, insulating top/bottom. Magnetic: uniform disk current; outer finite rectangle Az = 0.} wraplength 280} layout {row 3 column 0 sticky ew}} {id mesh_form type section parent mesh properties title\ \{Bounded\ triangular\ mesh\} layout {row 0 column 0 sticky new}} {id mesh_size type field parent mesh_form properties label\ \{Nominal\ maximum\ mesh\ size\ (m)\}\ datatype\ double\ default\ 0.005\ min\ 0 layout {row 0 column 0 sticky ew}} {id mesh_note type label parent mesh_form properties {text {Real Gmsh triangles, at most 30,000 cells and 60,000 nodes. The native model owner validates geometry and radius resolution. Mesh studies require separate genuine runs.} wraplength 280} layout {row 1 column 0 sticky ew}} {id solve_form type section parent solve properties title\ \{Managed\ FEM\ execution\} layout {row 0 column 0 sticky nsew weight 1}} {id solve_status type status parent solve_form properties {text {No Job selected. Use a model's retained Jobs list to reconnect.}} layout {row 0 column 0 sticky ew}} {id solve_log type log parent solve_form properties {text {No solver run has been performed by this candidate.} height 15 width 36} layout {row 1 column 0 sticky nsew weight 1}} {id result_form type section parent results properties title\ \{Canonical\ verified\ fields\} layout {row 0 column 0 sticky new}} {id field_dataset type dataset_selector parent result_form properties {label {Canonical tabular Dataset} content_kind table} layout {row 0 column 0 sticky ew}} {id result_note type label parent result_form properties {text {Publish explicitly from a verified source-current Job. Exact field display validates original linked node/cell roles; Dataset table inspection alone does not certify FEM results.} wraplength 280} layout {row 1 column 0 sticky ew}} {id result_report type log parent result_form properties {text {Inspect results shows the original solver/residual checks, bounded cell preview, units and source identity. A completed Job alone does not certify physical accuracy.} height 8 width 36} layout {row 2 column 0 sticky nsew weight 1}} {id learning_notes type log parent learning properties {text {Supported science
Linear static planar 2D electrostatics and magnetostatics only.

Electric reference
V(x) = Vapplied (x + half_width)/(2 half_width)
Ex = −Vapplied/(2 half_width); Ey = 0
This is the ideal homogeneous rectangle, without plate fringing.

Magnetic reference
I = Jz π a²
For μr = 1 and an unbounded domain:
Bθ(r ≥ a) = μ0 I/(2πr)
Bθ(r < a) = μ0 Jz r/2
The actual finite outer rectangle changes this reference.

Residuals are not uncertainty. Compare real fields, source mesh current and multiple densities.

Unavailable: full 3D, nonlinear B–H, axisymmetric, transient, arbitrary CAD, terminal L/R/C and SPICE extraction.} height 27 width 36} layout {row 0 column 0 sticky nsew weight 1}} {id field_plot type plot parent exact_field_view properties {title {Exact FEM cell field}} layout {row 0 column 0 sticky nsew weight 1 manager grid}} {id plot_note type label parent exact_field_view properties {text {Original node coordinates and triangle connectivity; each field value is constant on its source cell. Select a qualified field Dataset, then Show field.} wraplength 700} layout {row 1 column 0 sticky ew manager grid}} {id help type help parent footer properties {} layout {row 1 column 0 sticky ew}} {id workspace type workspace parent footer properties {} layout {row 2 column 0 sticky ew}} {id history type history parent footer properties {} layout {row 3 column 0 sticky ew}} {id result_views type tabs parent canvas properties {} layout {row 0 column 0 sticky nsew weight 1}} {id exact_field_view type tab parent result_views properties title\ \{Exact\ cell\ field\} layout {}} {id table_view type tab parent result_views properties title\ \{Dataset\ table\} layout {}} {id canonical_table type document parent table_view properties kind\ table\ title\ \{Canonical\ read-only\ Dataset\ table\} layout {row 0 column 0 sticky nsew weight 1}} {id inspect_table type action parent result_form properties {label {Inspect Dataset table} action inspect_table tooltip {Open the selected canonical table through the existing read-only Dataset Preview owner.}} layout {row 3 column 0 sticky ew}} {id table_note type label parent table_view properties text\ \{Select\ a\ canonical\ tabular\ Dataset\ in\ Results,\ then\ choose\ Inspect\ Dataset\ table.\ This\ read-only\ view\ preserves\ the\ source\ identity;\ inspection\ does\ not\ verify\ a\ FEM\ result.\}\ wraplength\ 700 layout {row 1 column 0 sticky ew}} {id results_menu type menu parent menubar properties {label Results actions {em_results em_publish em_field em_field_3d em_profile em_publish_charts em_export_field inspect_table}} layout {}} {id em_models type choice parent model_form properties label\ \{Saved\ scientific\ model\}\ choices\ \{\}\ default\ \{\} layout {row 5 column 0 sticky ew}} {id em_jobs type choice parent solve_form properties label\ \{Retained\ model\ Job\}\ choices\ \{\}\ default\ \{\} layout {row 2 column 0 sticky ew}} {id em_output_id type field parent result_form properties label\ \{New\ field\ Dataset\ ID\}\ datatype\ string\ default\ em_field layout {row 4 column 0 sticky ew}} {id model_actions type panel parent model_form properties {} layout {row 6 column 0 sticky ew}} {id solve_actions type panel parent solve_form properties {} layout {row 3 column 0 sticky ew}} {id result_actions type panel parent result_form properties {} layout {row 5 column 0 sticky ew}} {id toolbar_actions type panel parent toolbar properties {} layout {row 0 column 0 sticky ew}} {id em_refresh type action parent model_actions properties {label {Refresh models} action em_refresh tooltip {List actual saved scientific models; do not submit a Job.}} layout {row 0 column 0 sticky ew}} {id em_new_electric type action parent model_actions properties {label {New electric} action em_new_electric tooltip {Load a normalized unsaved electrostatic draft from the original scientific service.}} layout {row 1 column 0 sticky ew}} {id em_new_magnetic type action parent model_actions properties {label {New magnetic} action em_new_magnetic tooltip {Load a normalized unsaved magnetostatic draft from the original scientific service.}} layout {row 1 column 1 sticky ew}} {id em_validate type action parent toolbar_actions properties {label Validate action em_validate tooltip {Validate the current SI model and mesh plan without running FEM.}} layout {row 0 column 0 sticky ew}} {id em_open type action parent toolbar_actions properties {label Open action em_open tooltip {Open the selected original scientific model.}} layout {row 0 column 1 sticky ew}} {id em_save type action parent toolbar_actions properties {label Save action em_save tooltip {Save the current scientific model through its original Workspace owner.} icon em_save_icon} layout {row 0 column 2 sticky ew}} {id em_duplicate type action parent model_actions properties {label Duplicate action em_duplicate tooltip {Create a separate owned scientific model copy through the shared Workspace service.}} layout {row 2 column 0 sticky ew}} {id em_workspaces type action parent model_actions properties {label Workspaces action em_workspaces tooltip {Open the original model Workspace manager and its guarded lifecycle actions.}} layout {row 2 column 1 sticky ew}} {id em_rename type action parent model_actions properties {label Rename action em_rename tooltip {Rename the current scientific model without changing its identity.}} layout {row 3 column 0 sticky ew}} {id em_run type action parent toolbar_actions properties {label {Run FEM} action em_run tooltip {Save and run actual configured Gmsh/GetDP through the managed CORE provider.} icon em_play_icon} layout {row 0 column 3 sticky ew}} {id em_list_jobs type action parent solve_actions properties {label {List Jobs} action em_list_jobs tooltip {List actual retained Jobs for this scientific model.}} layout {row 0 column 0 sticky ew}} {id em_reconnect type action parent solve_actions properties {label Reconnect action em_reconnect tooltip {Reconnect to the selected retained Job; do not resubmit it.}} layout {row 0 column 1 sticky ew}} {id em_status_action type action parent solve_actions properties {label Status action em_status_action tooltip {Read the current durable Job state.}} layout {row 1 column 0 sticky ew}} {id em_cancel type action parent toolbar_actions properties {label Cancel action em_cancel tooltip {Request cancellation of the owned Job; inspect its actual terminal state.} icon em_stop_icon} layout {row 0 column 4 sticky ew}} {id em_log_action type action parent solve_actions properti